> KB[#]01214-How to get a list of SPROC[s] from a BBj program[ | BAS]IS International Ltd.
Here[ is] a simple BBj[ program that will] print out a list of SPROC[s] in a[ database] along with their[ descriptions.] The[ java.]sql.Database[Meta]Data interface in the[ Java] API[ docs] contains the information about SPROCs (or other[ database items] like tables,[ functions],[ indexes],[ etc.).
]![db]Meta in the sample[ code] is an[ instance] of this interface[.]

